   "intro": "An old man in sunglasses is burning a notebook in a metal bin. \"Riddle. What wears armor and has never been in danger? A prisoner. I built the first suit. Giovanni asked me to make it obey. I said the armor could do one or the other: protect it or hold it.\"",
   "choices": [
    {
     "label": "Take the page",
     "success": {
      "text": "Four seals. Shoulders, chest, crown. They vent in order, like a kettle. \"Don't fight it. Fight the suit.\"",
      "effects": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "rocket-seal-diagram",
        "amount": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "label": "\"Come with me.\"",
     "success": {
      "text": "He folds the sunglasses into his pocket. \"Lead on.\"",
      "effects": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "rocket-blaine-ally",
        "amount": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "label": "\"Why didn't you stop him?\"",
     "success": {
      "text": "\"No riddle for that one.\"",
      "effects": []
     }
    }
   ]
  },
